{"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0090", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:daac63e157cd8f7d5661d257391c9c589ff60b0e784bc872ee4e71db6b606cef", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIt may not be completely obvious how to compose morphisms of\nringed spaces hence we spell it out here.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c1e867337360378db7a953c222a6377a9923ad24849ffad2a34d70a9c6e46006", "unit_id": "tag:0090:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0090", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(f, f^\\sharp) : (X, \\mathcal{O}_X) \\to (Y, \\mathcal{O}_Y)$", "MATH_0002": "$(g, g^\\sharp) : (Y, \\mathcal{O}_Y) \\to (Z, \\mathcal{O}_Z)$", "MATH_0003": "$$\n(g, g^\\sharp) \\circ (f, f^\\sharp) = (g \\circ f, f^\\sharp \\circ g^\\sharp).\n$$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-composition-f-maps}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-composition-maps-ringed-spaces}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e8dc643cb4a11e6b698c0c1131bc9a4efa41a00865258c4e8527a7205a4380b8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:05558353d7f593de501b6e4dfafb92f52ee735590ab51316b96bc454f0d1705f", "source_text": "Let\n<MATH_0001> and\n<MATH_0002>\nbe morphisms of ringed spaces. Then we define\nthe <TEXTITOPEN_0001>composition of morphisms of ringed spaces<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\nby the rule\n<MATH_0003>\nHere we use composition of <MATH_0004>-maps defined in\nDefinition <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d9fcee68898c5e29d09c92fa65905dd014f795fe33463b3004e2dca03d4c7b5b", "unit_id": "tag:0093:statement"}
